{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29048","headline":"晚自东郭回留一二游侣 · 许浑","name":"晚自东郭回留一二游侣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乡心迢遰宦情微，吏散寻幽竟落晖。\n林下草腥巢鹭宿，洞前云湿雨龙归。\n钟随野艇回孤棹，鼓绝山城掩半扉。\n今夜西斋好风月，一瓢春酒莫相违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29048.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29048","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}